# <type>(<scope>): <subject> (imperative mood, max 50-72 chars)
#
# Types:
#   feat     : New feature or parity capability
#   fix      : Bug fix or parser correction
#   perf     : Performance or memory allocation optimization
#   refactor : Code restructuring without behavior changes
#   test     : Unit, integration, or parity tests
#   docs     : Documentation or architecture updates
#   chore    : Dependencies, tooling, or workspace maintenance
#   ci       : Continuous integration changes
#
# Scopes:
#   core, similarity, parser, engine, cli, headless, hybrid, scope, deps, corpus
#
# Body:
#   Explain the problem, motivation, and solution in detail.
#
# Footer:
#   Closes #123
#   Ref: KATANA_ARCHITECTURE_CORPUS Section X.Y
